^CONVERSION ERROR$
--
User-reported: `__attribute__((__packed__))` on an enum was honoured by
the C front end but ignored by the C++ front end, so
`static_assert(sizeof(E) == 1)` failed on packed-enum ABIs (1-byte
instruction fields in firmware).  The underlying type of an unscoped
enum without enumeration-base is implementation-defined (N5008
[dcl.enum]/8); packed selects the smallest sufficient type, matching
g++/clang++.  Scoped enums have a fixed underlying type ([dcl.enum]/5)
and are not affected.
